n":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-03-16T14:21:36Z","updated_at":"2025-03-21T12:13:54Z","closed_at":"2025-03-21T12:05:23Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104237","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104237","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104237.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104237.patch","merged_at":"2025-03-21T12:05:23Z"},"body":"I profiled tps demo during gameplay and noticed 9.6% of time is spent on self time of `WorkerThreadPool::_thread_function`, specifically waiting for mutexes.\r\n\r\nI found low hanging fruit to optimize: The current implementation needlessly unlocks and relocks the `task_mutex` on notification for the next task. This can be avoided by refactoring the function to have an inner loop, which avoids constructing `MutexLock lock` again each iteration, which is the cause of the needless unlock and relock.\r\n\r\n## Profile Results\r\n\r\nThis optimization reduces the total CPU use of tps demo by about  2.3% (from `_thread_function`):\r\n```\r\n684.00 ms   9,6 %\t0 s\t  WorkerThreadPool::_thread_function(void*)\r\n305.00 ms   4,3 %\t0 s\t  WorkerThreadPool::_process_task(WorkerThreadPool::Task*)\r\n292.00 ms   4,1 %\t0 s\t  MDCommandBuffer::render_draw_indexed(unsigned int, unsigned int, unsigned int, int, unsigned int)\r\n```\r\n(current master)\r\n\r\n```\r\n736.00 ms   7,3 %\t0 s\t  WorkerThreadPool::_thread_function(void*)\r\n477.00 ms   4,7 %\t0 s\t  MDCommandBuffer::render_draw_indexed(unsigned int, unsigned int, unsigned int, int, unsigned int)\r\n453.00 ms   4,5 %\t0 s\t  WorkerThreadPool::_process_task(WorkerThreadPool::Task*)\r\n```\r\n(this PR)\r\n\r\nMy measurements didn't indicate a practical fps improvement. I think this is because this optimization does not affect the critical path. However, the total CPU load should still be lower than before.\r\n\r\n## Addendum\r\nI think `_wait_collaboratively` suffers from the same problem. It should probably be optimized in a future PR. \r\nHowever, its total CPU impact is much lower, and it is much more complex, so I didn't bother.","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104237/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":2,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104237/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}